OL,3,GNEWSAConvicted rapist who abused wife  
OL,4,Awas 'master manipulator'               
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains details 
OL,7,Fthat some may find distressing         
OL,9,FA woman whose husband raped and        
OL,10,Fsexually assaulted her has said he was 
OL,11,Fa "master manipulator who knew exactly 
OL,12,Fwhat he was doing".                    
OL,14,FJoanne Donald reported the abuse, which
OL,15,Fhad happened "hundreds of times over   
OL,16,Fthe years", to the Police Service of   
OL,17,FNorthern Ireland (PSNI) in 2019.       
OL,19,FMichael Donald, 50, from Belfast, was  
OL,20,Fconvicted by a jury of three counts of 
OL,21,Frape and three counts of sexual        
OL,22,Fassault.                               
